    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102508" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ταρτησσός</span></b> , ὁ, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			1.163
		</span></i>, elsewh. ἡ:—a district of
		Spain at the mouth of the Baetis, the <u>Tarshish</u> of
		Scripture (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θαρσείς</span> in <i><span class="en">
			LXX
			<u>3 Ki.</u>
			10.22
		</span></i>, al.), Hdt.l.c., <i><span class="en">
			Arist.
			<u>Mir.</u>
			844a17
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Str.
			3.2.11
		</span></i>, etc.: also the river Baetis, <i><span class="en">
			Stesich.
			5
		</span></i> (ap.Str.l.c.):—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ταρτήσσιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <u>Tartessian</u>, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			4.192
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Ra.</u>
			475
		</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ταρτήσσιοι</span></b> , οἱ, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			1.163
		</span></i>, etc.</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
